<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on European paper basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on European paper basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 1.25 million American-style call warrants, on a basket of European paper comprising Stora AB, NV Koninklijke KNP BT, Enso Oy, UPM-Kymmene Oy, Jefferson Smurfit, Svenska Cellulosa, MoDo AB, AssiDoman, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    831.60 DEM		ISSUE PRICE  43.56 DEM</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	14.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  792.00 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
